# Gitignored files copied into every worktree Claude Code creates.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so it starts with no untracked files. Without
# this, a parallel session boots with no DATABASE_URL, no BETTER_AUTH_SECRET and
# no LLM key, and every prisma command and most of the suite fails there.
#
# .gitignore syntax. Only paths that match AND are gitignored are copied, so a
# tracked file listed here is never duplicated.
.env
